  "_comment": "Edge: a CROSS-SCHEME alignment. SKOS separates in-scheme semantic relations (broader/narrower/related) from the mapping properties used between schemes (*Match); v0.2 adds broadMatch, narrowMatch, and relatedMatch so an alignment to an external thesaurus no longer has to borrow the in-scheme relation and misstate itself."
